# SQLite backup inventory template.
#
# Real config path:
# /etc/the-hub-backup/sqlite.conf
#
# Preferred format:
# system|source_kind|source_ref|output_name|retention_days|criticality
#
# source_kind:
# - host_path  -> source_ref must point to the host-visible production DB
# - docker_cp  -> source_ref must use container_name:/path/to/db
#
# Legacy host-path lines without source_kind are still accepted:
# system|source_path|output_name|retention_days|criticality
#
Traect|host_path|/home/katrin/projects/traect/data/traect.db|traect|30|important
Echo|host_path|/home/katrin/data/echo/echo.db|echo|30|important
Postbox|host_path|/home/katrin/projects/postbox/data/postbox.db|postbox|30|important
Uptime Kuma|host_path|/home/katrin/projects/uptime-kuma/data/kuma.db|uptime-kuma|30|important
Grafana|docker_cp|grafana:/var/lib/grafana/grafana.db|grafana|30|important
